title: Cooperation with Jewish Organisations
subtitle: The range of agreements, above all with the Bund.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/flags.jpg
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_party_rules && PolishParty.stanceAvailable(Q, 'jewish_cooperation') !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card party.jewish_cooperation (catalogue 4.7; technical reference 10.8): 1 T, 0 R, the card then waits 6 months. The present line is shown and cannot be
// chosen again; closing the card is free (Z — 0.32).
PolishParty.stanceView(Q, 'jewish_cooperation');
!}

= Cooperation with Jewish Organisations

The present line: **[+ pl_stance_current +]**. A new declaration costs this month's action; it changes no law in force and gives no reform by itself.

- @broad
- @labour_only
- @none
- @easy_discard

@broad
title: Broad cooperation and rights in the programme
subtitle: Agreements on rights and joint actions; axis +2.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'jewish_cooperation', 'broad').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_broad_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'jewish_cooperation', 'broad');
!}
go-to: result

@labour_only
title: Cooperation of workers’ organisations
subtitle: Agreements of labour, above all with the Bund; axis 0.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'jewish_cooperation', 'labour_only').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_labour_only_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'jewish_cooperation', 'labour_only');
!}
go-to: result

@none
title: No cooperation
subtitle: No new joint actions; existing rights of citizens stay; axis −2.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.stanceStatus(Q, 'jewish_cooperation', 'none').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_stance_none_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.stanceChoose(Q, 'jewish_cooperation', 'none');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

